Package: folio-sheets
Version: 0.10.0
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 4604
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), libc6 (>= 2.34), libcairo2, libpango-1.0-0, libpangocairo-1.0-0, libglib2.0-0, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, librsvg2-common, fonts-crosextra-carlito, fonts-crosextra-caladea, fonts-liberation2 | fonts-liberation
Recommends: libreoffice-calc-nogui | libreoffice-calc, xdg-utils, libhunspell-1.7-0, hunspell-en-us | hunspell-dictionary, mythes-en-us | mythes-thesaurus
Maintainer: Ron Shillings <ron.shillings@gmail.com>
Description: ribbon spreadsheet
 Folio Sheets is a spreadsheet with a ribbon interface, KeyTips, a File
 view, the standard desktop spreadsheet keyboard shortcuts and .xlsx as its
 native format, kept lossless: whatever it doesn't understand is saved
 back untouched.
